# ring_run.jsc - Ring Run on autopilot for 60 s.
# Checks (group D): autopilot passes >= 10 rings in 60 s with no crash. Run with --wav to hear
# the chimes. Shots every 10 s.
0     state title
+0    state ring
+0    autopilot on
+10   shot ring_10s
+10   shot ring_20s
+10   shot ring_30s
+10   shot ring_40s
+10   shot ring_50s
+0    sheet ring_run 5
+10   assert rings >= 10
+0    assert crashes == 0
+0    assert state != GAMEOVER
+0    end
